{"4947900":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Augmented Yut","steam_appid":4947900,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5313840],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple race around a board. Until someone starts playing chess.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Yutnori<\/strong>, a traditional Korean board game where you toss sticks and race your pieces to the finish.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds simple, right?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Except you can poop all over the board.<\/strong><br><strong>Or win by getting beaten up by every other player.<\/strong><br><strong>Or turn your opponent’s best ability into a useless cat.<\/strong><br><strong>Or just... cancel someone else’s win.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 90 game-changing augments, things can get out of hand pretty quickly. Combine bizarre rules, pull off ridiculous strategies, and find new ways to win every match!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–10 Player Online Multiplayer<\/strong> — Play with friends or strangers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based strategy<\/strong> — Turn-based strategy built on traditional Korean Yutnori.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 Unique Augments<\/strong> — Discover different combinations every match.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Match &amp; Private Lobbies<\/strong> — Jump into a game or create your own room.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anything Can Happen<\/strong> — Special pieces, traps, changing boards, and alternative win conditions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Some Sound Effect Credits<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in this game: UI button click sound<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edited: O<br>Creator: Nathan Gibson<br>License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This license applies only to the sound effect in question and does not apply to the game as a whole.)<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple race around a board. Until someone starts playing chess.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Yutnori<\/strong>, a traditional Korean board game where you toss sticks and race your pieces to the finish.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds simple, right?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Except you can poop all over the board.<\/strong><br><strong>Or win by getting beaten up by every other player.<\/strong><br><strong>Or turn your opponent’s best ability into a useless cat.<\/strong><br><strong>Or just... cancel someone else’s win.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 90 game-changing augments, things can get out of hand pretty quickly. Combine bizarre rules, pull off ridiculous strategies, and find new ways to win every match!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–10 Player Online Multiplayer<\/strong> — Play with friends or strangers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based strategy<\/strong> — Turn-based strategy built on traditional Korean Yutnori.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 Unique Augments<\/strong> — Discover different combinations every match.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Match &amp; Private Lobbies<\/strong> — Jump into a game or create your own room.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anything Can Happen<\/strong> — Special pieces, traps, changing boards, and alternative win conditions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Some Sound Effect Credits<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in this game: UI button click sound<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edited: O<br>Creator: Nathan Gibson<br>License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This license applies only to the sound effect in question and does not apply to the game as a whole.)<\/p>","short_description":"Race to the finish—unless someone turns it into chess. A chaotic online strategy board game for 2–10 players, based on traditional Korean Yutnori. Mix 90 game-changing augments, break the rules, and find ridiculous ways to win.","supported_languages":"Korean, English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4947900\/2d8363900ed4272b3b754df76f953b30c3942ff8\/header.jpg?t=1792488637","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4947900\/65f1e05a247f83d0791b3899f13812985dd33497\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792488637","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4947900\/65f1e05a247f83d0791b3899f13812985dd33497\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792488637","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit x86 processor with SSE4.2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Ausuruk G